Description: optional managed PaddleOCR plugin for ksnip-pyqt6
 This plugin adds an optional Model Manager to ksnip-pyqt6. It creates a
 private Python virtual environment under the user's data directory, installs
 PaddlePaddle and PaddleOCR there, and configures the core Script OCR backend
 to use the managed launcher.
 .
 The plugin displays the environment, model cache, pip cache, and installed
 package directories, together with their sizes and buttons that open them in
 the system file manager.
 .
 This package is intended for upstream/GitHub installations. It downloads
 Python packages at runtime and is not part of the Debian main archive.
